  </div>
  <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"
         style="width:100%;background:#eef2f5;border-collapse:collapse;">
    <tr>
      <td align="center" style="padding:22px 10px;">
        <table role="presentation" width="680" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"
               style="width:680px;max-width:680px;background:#ffffff;border-collapse:collapse;">
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0;background:#051b34;">
              <img src="https://www.patricknovick.com/api/images/2" width="680"
                   alt="Inspectors Needed Now for Connecticut DOT Projects"
                   style="display:block;width:680px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;">
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:32px 40px 14px 40px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#25384b;">
              <div style="font-size:13px;line-height:18px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:1.1px;color:#b98500;">IMMEDIATE CONNECTICUT INSPECTOR OPENINGS</div>
              <h1 style="margin:8px 0 16px 0;font-size:27px;line-height:34px;color:#071b31;">
                Inspectors Needed Now for Connecticut DOT Projects
              </h1>
              <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26384b;">Hello {{first_name}},</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26384b;">Metro Associates is recruiting experienced construction inspectors for active and upcoming transportation and infrastructure projects throughout Connecticut.</p>
              <p style="margin:0 0 15px 0;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;color:#26384b;">Opportunities may include day and night shifts across roadway, bridge, structural, paving and utility projects. Competitive compensation is available based on experience, certifications and project requirements.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 40px 23px 40px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">
              <table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"
                     style="width:100%;background:#f5f7f9;border:1px solid #d9e0e7;border-collapse:collapse;">
                <tr>
                  <td style="padding:18px 20px;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#26384b;">
                    <strong style="color:#071b31;">Recruiting focus:</strong><br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> CTDOT roadway and bridge inspection<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Construction and paving inspection<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Day and night project assignments<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Chief, senior and mid-level inspector roles<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Roadway, structural and utility disciplines<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> NETTCP, ATSSA, ACI, NICET and OSHA credentials valued
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 40px 18px 40px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#26384b;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;">Send your updated resume, current location, certifications, preferred shift and compensation requirements. Projects are moving quickly, so qualified inspectors are encouraged to respond today.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="left" style="padding:8px 40px 32px 40px;">
              <!--[if mso]>
