                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Construction and paving inspection<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Day and night project assignments<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Chief, senior and mid-level inspector roles<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> Roadway, structural and utility disciplines<br>
                    <span style="color:#b98500;">&#10003;</span> NETTCP, ATSSA, ACI, NICET and OSHA credentials valued
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding:0 40px 18px 40px;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#26384b;">
              <p style="margin:0;font-size:16px;line-height:25px;">Send your updated resume, current location, certifications, preferred shift and compensation requirements. Projects are moving quickly, so qualified inspectors are encouraged to respond today.</p>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td align="left" style="padding:8px 40px 32px 40px;">
